Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:16.88,Title,,0,0,0,,Glove breaking in beast of prey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please run an errand for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.51,0:01:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum is busy with the chores, so you must...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.81,0:01:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No is no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.61,0:01:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,At home you don't read\Nanyway,but simply kill times
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So you should be asked\Nby shopping something
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than going out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable, young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant is angry again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't speak that name...\NIMy body trembles just by listening to his name!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just stay home\Nfor your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's really terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.57,0:02:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can take you any more\NGive me back the magic weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Glove breaking in beast of prey
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Any beast animal would speak\Nas soon as a little touched with it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,For example...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, if you stay home\Nthen listen to your mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.09,0:02:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come... come... come...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.77,0:03:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.44,0:03:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,wonderfu, Doraemon\NLend this to me,to me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Note:It's only effective for five minutes\Nremember? Only five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No more fears
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out,come out,Gian
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow... it's Gian
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing actually?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am still scared...\Ncan't come close to it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not come close nothing can work
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:04:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You do have gloves with you, be brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I have gloves with no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.77,0:04:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think which team would win?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.57,0:04:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course giant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.07,0:04:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian...Wow...\N(Giant sounds the same like Gian)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.01,0:04:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't get rid\Nof fears to him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Really hard to do. How to make you\Nclose to him? Well, lets' do this way
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi,how are you doing? Touching...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie prone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful, I made it\NSuccess comes only with care
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:04:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, so is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact it's so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.19,0:05:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Really marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let everyone see it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody will admire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real, full of\Nexciting breaking in beast of prey
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget yourself immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait and will see
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned creature, you are\Nactually here. Nobita, wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Gian rushes here with anger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, don't worry.\NHave a good look at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...monkey
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch... touch...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie prone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How marvelous
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on... stand upside down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.68,0:06:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now have a look\Nat the more difficult show
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I will have it jump onto this platform\Nand then pass through this circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If succeed,\Neverybody gives an applause,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come... jump over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Really good
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a really master
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Per request from the audience\NI will raise the circle's height
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come... jump over
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid, once again
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, time is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, five minutes passed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, nothing. Although I just\Nescaped in hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Touching with this glove slightly\Nno fears to any beast of prey
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, help me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't' want to be beaten for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You come over to me, Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancestors, come on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Salute
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:08:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is polite. This is a\Nheritage from my ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo's ancestor was a samurai
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He was very strong and\Nsave his master various times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then we are minister president\Ngenerations for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the master your ancestor\Nis the highest ranked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Every family has its own origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.19,0:08:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not your turn to open big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned guy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So it is, he laughs at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Never lose to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take Time machine to see your ancestor.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In such a big mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he is a hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anybody live in such remote area?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.19,0:08:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, hit... it's big Tanuki
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What Tanuki...\NThank goodness I am a robot
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my eyes are small.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I am hunter Nobisaku
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Its' really him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me\Nstay away...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why come to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should get some chickens,\Nrabbits or mice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Succeed, my technique is really not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Really like Suneo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Suneo's ancestor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Behave yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think who I am'?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Honegawa's family first\Nson, Honegawa Omaru
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be so impolite to Samurai\NKnee down and make kowtow at once
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I will cut off your heads
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Omaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing,\Nget ready to battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, finally march on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I will come make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Very reliable. The master\Nwill be happy with your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarnorai is very handsome\NI really also want to be Samorai...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.39,0:10:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What, I should go to battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, then you get power and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I don't want money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Really useless
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,Nobisaku's face\Nlooks very like yours
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You go to battlefield for him.\NI will adjust that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:11:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I don't want money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to lose to Suneo this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see where to bring the armor and the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,March on... march on...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me your armor, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What nonsense are you talking\NI just want to be on battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma' the strongest one in this village\NTry it if you don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful bullet, must be very\Nvaluable.Exchange that with my armo,ok
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remove my clothes, you can have 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.46,0:11:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we do so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bamboo 'copter\Ntransparent cloak, supper gloves
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's no need to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose side should I take?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whomever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ally the just party.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,In wars, both sides think they're the ones who're just, that's just how the wars go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch the head of the opposite\Nhand him over to one's own head.\NEither of the war parties thinks their\Nside would be the right and justice one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch the head of the opposite\Nhand him over to one's own head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so he's the warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand him to the opposite head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, the victory belongs to our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I also caught one alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Omaru
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, behead these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to kill them.\NYou're going way too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to defy my orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Behead this guy too while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Behead me? Not in your lifetime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll help these poor guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,With these gadgets by your side, you have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right,\Nexchange with them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Be clear that you saved the lord and Sunemaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This way your ancestor\Nbecame 2nd most powerful man
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just told you our ancestor was hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing has changed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's odd, let's see what happened using the Time TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved you, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done! From today, you're going to be my right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's my ancestor doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time\Nin my life I hunted wild pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.61,0:14:21.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(434,25)}The Girl Like a White Lily
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,During WWII, Japan's important cities were under constant bombardment by the Allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For safety, children were evacuated to the deep countryside,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,along with their friends and teachers...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This was called the kids' evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Conditions were harsh and there was absolutely no way to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead we dug air-raid shelters, tilled fields, that was our daily life, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be very hungry all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That chocolate tasted so good. Even today I can still reminisce its' taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Really romantic story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know the name\Nand address of that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl, "as pretty as a White Lily!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it! She'll get the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.02,0:15:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Be honest with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a story from my childhood!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy must love her very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He should have taken a picture or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it! We can go take one! With the time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea! Then we can give the photo to dad as a souveneir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea! Then we can give the photo to dad as a souveneir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside this temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody is working in fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has time for lesson\Nnot even any food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even kid goes to fieldwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What would be Japans future?\NOh my god, oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.75,0:16:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so lazy? Nobi, do you\Nthink this would count anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, teacher, my hand is\Nfull of bubbles, stomach empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He is daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This little difficulty counts nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.93,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of\Nthe hard soldiers on battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, 30 minutes break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,NO need to beat him\NReally too extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:17:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi, you are not allowed to\Nrest before finishing this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How pitiful, can not see that any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Very bad, unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep aside the roads like that\Nsoon teacher will criticize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It does not matter\NYou replace him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you say that, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Supper gloves
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All problems\Nwill be solved if using this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You see we almost finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.31,0:17:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this kind of girl's haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Really not formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Give you this for haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want it, very ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute for restoring\Nit to the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:18:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In such a chaotic time\Nall we Japanese have to be united.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Produce more for the country\Nbut you have such haircut
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well Nobi, you finish that alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Really unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, very good, this is Japanese boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help we\Nhave nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's work ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Very bad, we'll be punished\Nheavily. Run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, daddy disappears
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be on riverside
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.84,0:18:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll wait for white lily coming
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you restore my haircut\Nduring this waiting time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,30 minutes hair formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost dawn,\Nwhite lily is still not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for her in the near.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't' run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Deodorant your body. I'll get\Nsome suitable cloths for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, I just want to die\Nand finish everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Borrowed from the cloth shelf over there
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is girl's cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}3D minutes are over.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:20:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,body is white, hair is very long\Neyes are round, girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember in Doraemon's pocket...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact it's such a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Films are taken, but
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.98,0:20:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, if symbolized with flower
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,just like white lily,\Nbeautiful and clean
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This memory remains\Nbeautiful memory forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Say one thing but mean others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am care... ful going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Doraemon helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You look at this chaos yourself\NCan you keep your own room in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed with Shizuka to play outside.\NI will get it in order when coming back
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No nonsense any more.YOU won't do\Nanything when coming back, bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You are already grade four
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even order your\Nroom. Aren't you ashamed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi... mom soon as you open\Nyour mouth, you'll never stop
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.05,0:21:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to bring your things in order..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.19,0:21:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon is even watching aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, What attitude do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:22:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you think so\Nlet's start from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita is really marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It does not matter not listen to your\Nmom. Go and play with Shizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.02,0:22:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter actually?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Only because of this flute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.89,0:22:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is called flute say one mean others\NIts frequency can make people crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.33,0:22:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What they actually do is\Nthe opposite what they think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact so, therefore very angry mom\Npaises me on the contrary
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.94,0:22:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful, so I can\Nplay without any concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.95,0:22:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think of that too beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, why come to that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,land Shizuka have\Narranged, as I said
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if you do so with heart\Nyou can finish that immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.53,0:22:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, I borrowed a wrong flute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.50,0:22:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, what do you want to do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.37,0:23:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take a bath\Nand have my body cleaned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.31,0:23:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Stop it ...Help
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.18,0:23:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be a waste for this\Ninteresting flute if not used well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your cloths. They are so\Nbeautiful however to look at
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but compared to\Nyours it's still very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.20,0:23:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you even dare\Nto ware that ugly stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She wares the same anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.38,0:23:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, this is baseball bat\NI just bought. Let me try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.15,0:23:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, help
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, please hit me with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.83,0:24:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka, I take good stuff\Nand show you, Shizuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned, somebody disturbs\Njust when met good chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, don't move, no sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka, what's the matter...\Nit's me, Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.44,0:24:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him away...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.21,0:24:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it finally, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.22,0:24:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.62,0:24:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.59,0:24:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, come in...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.49,0:24:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down wherever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.59,0:24:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, not so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.17,0:24:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Shizuka\NHow come you become like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.10,0:24:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That man is a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.94,0:24:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some tea
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then I have to go, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.15,0:24:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you escape on your own? Not good
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.45,0:25:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy, come back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.32,0:25:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, I am a thief to steal something
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.53,0:25:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You damned guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.83,0:25:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.33,0:25:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.47,0:25:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You guy are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.01,0:25:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.01,0:25:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my purse. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.78,0:25:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this pullover also for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.02,0:25:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even this pair of trousers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.62,0:25:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What else then'?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.06,0:25:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, underwear also for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.73,0:25:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No more, no more, I don't want underwear
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.60,0:25:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you, today's weather\Nis very good...see you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.50,0:25:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.77,0:25:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.31,0:25:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I say stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.98,0:26:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, don't' feel strange with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.98,0:26:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You bloody guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.45,0:26:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.12,0:26:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, think about it thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.86,0:26:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, damned guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.01,0:26:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.01,0:26:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I am thief, catch me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.65,0:26:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you made the room\Nso clean, really marvelous
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.19,0:26:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.75,0:26:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I am really very happy\NNobita listens to me so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.93,0:26:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.67,0:26:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.44,0:27:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Doraemon,\Ndon't open your big mouth any more.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.44,0:27:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, why do you listen so much to\Nmom. I won't forgive you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.98,0:27:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, I won't listen to\Nher any more. Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.49,0:27:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,asia_cartoons@sinarnan.cor-n
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.33,0:27:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Time camera
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.20,0:27:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Very strange, over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.34,0:27:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, I have something to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.11,0:27:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Why sighing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.02,0:27:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Any concerns? Daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.36,0:27:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sighing does not solve\Nanything. Do you feel bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.96,0:27:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am calling mom coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no need, no need to call mom here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.96,0:28:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Very strange How to do then'?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.20,0:28:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.01,0:28:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually I lost my purse\Nwhile buying cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.64,0:28:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Purse
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.08,0:28:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappears
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.41,0:28:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can find\Nit even running back immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.28,0:28:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked around there, but found nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.32,0:28:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bad. If mom knows\Nthat, she will be very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.99,0:28:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And she will never stop if getting upset
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.46,0:28:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, what to do? Mom is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.86,0:28:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.33,0:28:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You are talking about whom\Nwhat very terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.60,0:28:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, it has nothing with daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.21,0:28:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Really about nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.11,0:28:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Really strange person
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.28,0:28:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.45,0:28:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How to you from tomorrow\Nif purse not found?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.06,0:29:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No cigarette to smoke,\Nnothing to eat nor to play
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.66,0:29:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Al joys in life will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.00,0:29:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy is really pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.13,0:29:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, help him, please
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.20,0:29:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Try this
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.31,0:29:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Time camera
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.75,0:29:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, take me also one picture
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.98,0:29:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,lam ready, Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.38,0:29:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, this is not a camera\Nfor now, but for the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.09,0:29:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking a picture 30 minutes ago\Nfor example in this room, first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.66,0:29:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I am taking picture
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.63,0:29:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Already done, how great
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.27,0:29:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.74,0:29:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, 300 minutes ago\NI was eating Dorayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.34,0:29:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What, I did not appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides Doraemon is very crafty\Neven eats on his own,unforgiveable
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.05,0:29:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.15,0:30:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned, you selfish guy
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.32,0:30:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there is only one
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.76,0:30:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one\Nshould be divided into half each.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.66,0:30:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry up,\Nfind daddy's Purse is more important{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.40,0:30:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right,\Nwe have to find daddy's Purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.27,0:30:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.97,0:30:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy bought cigarette here\NHere, it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy bought cigarette here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.14,0:30:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, take a picture and see
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.57,0:30:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, it was 40 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.48,0:30:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,40 minutes ago, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.98,0:30:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a picture and see
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.72,0:30:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Taken
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.65,0:30:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.82,0:30:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see, Purse taken
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.89,0:30:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We succeed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.42,0:30:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This means that his purse was\Ndropped on the way from hereto home
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.63,0:30:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take pictures while walking
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.43,0:30:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn to the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.20,0:30:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing and chatting with others
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Walked to here... wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.87,0:30:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing strange until here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.74,0:30:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stopped and watching something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.35,0:31:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Started walking again
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.05,0:31:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Continued walking
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.25,0:31:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was Nobita, what is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.42,0:31:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.89,0:31:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a wonderful camera
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.73,0:31:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me a picture
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.36,0:31:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, well... I am very busy now
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.63,0:31:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stingy, hurry up with photo
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.87,0:31:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Taken, Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.31,0:31:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No choice, that was 40 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.31,0:31:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not taken...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy disappears
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.22,0:31:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was daddy, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.19,0:31:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here... there...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.30,0:31:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Every side has to be taken in picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.60,0:31:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:31:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,not here
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.20,0:32:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,not here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.27,0:32:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Appears
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.31,0:32:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy watched here the baseball game
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.74,0:32:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take another one and see
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.71,0:32:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, daddy even disturbed them\Nby playing something with them
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.45,0:32:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, daddy lost his\Npurse when running there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.32,0:32:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dropped
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.79,0:32:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.93,0:32:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to find it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.63,0:32:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Very strange, it should be dropped here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.73,0:32:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.93,0:32:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe taken away by somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.37,0:32:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjust the time and\Ntake another picture, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.14,0:32:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact it was picked up by a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.28,0:32:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.65,0:32:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk along this way straight ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.82,0:32:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk further
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.69,0:32:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.39,0:32:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, over there
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.77,0:33:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumped into the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.00,0:33:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.17,0:33:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for bothering
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.01,0:33:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.51,0:33:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Found
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.32,0:33:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Doraemon, thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.69,0:33:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This camera is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.82,0:33:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU should be encouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.03,0:33:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was, Doraemon\Ncan you lend the camera to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.87,0:33:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.93,0:33:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a picture and then\Nwe know who stole Dorayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.54,0:33:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment, please
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.62,0:33:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Proposal war
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.16,0:34:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so many foods\NWhat's the matter, {\i1}mom'?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.13,0:34:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is the 12th anniversary of\Nthe marriage of you daddy and me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.10,0:34:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.37,0:34:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your food,\Ntoday's foods are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.54,0:34:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, help yourself, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.61,0:34:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.75,0:34:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us the memory on your wedding day
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.88,0:34:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daddy told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't marry me\NI will kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.66,0:34:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, no nonsense, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.83,0:34:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, what did you say
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.30,0:34:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You proposed me\Nand cried asking me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.31,0:34:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, you even lie\Nin front of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.74,0:34:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I lied? You are talking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.18,0:34:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.98,0:34:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems become very terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.18,0:35:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember very clearly\NDaddy proposed first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.29,0:35:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was not me, you proposed first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.22,0:35:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It was daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.16,0:35:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.73,0:35:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.26,0:35:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, if we can make it clear\Nthey will never stop arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.80,0:35:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No other choice,\Nlet's find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.55,0:35:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are, this is Shyowa39 year\Nmonth, day in Hibitani park
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.12,0:35:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was Nobita's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.26,0:35:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, over there
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.03,0:35:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where well
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.13,0:35:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Nobita's mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally different from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.34,0:35:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.04,0:35:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, just kidding
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.71,0:35:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't take it, so slow...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.18,0:36:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She said there are important things\Nto announce, but she is late.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.02,0:36:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,One hour late
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.49,0:36:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that daddy was late.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.62,0:36:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Tamako
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.89,0:36:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.30,0:36:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ms. Tamako\NI am even one hour late.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.23,0:36:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.10,0:36:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Tamako, Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.67,0:36:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Tamako, wait a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.65,0:36:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,fills. Tarnako,\NI was wrong, please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.35,0:36:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Tamako...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.75,0:36:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally you know wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.52,0:36:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi, I forgive you, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.36,0:36:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned, even use this method.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.36,0:36:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually I wanted propose\Nher. Forget it. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.43,0:36:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that things are wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.57,0:37:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean important thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.81,0:37:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.55,0:37:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.59,0:37:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.59,0:37:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.06,0:37:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned guy, remember that
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.19,0:37:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it\Nthanks brother
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.13,0:37:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't; spend it casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.00,0:37:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not thought of being\Ncheated for money by one's own sister
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.00,0:37:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, what is Ms. Tamako doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.37,0:37:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Forget it,\Nthat damned woman with no feeling.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.75,0:37:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman...\NI never want to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.75,0:37:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that things went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.39,0:37:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In this way it wouldn't go to marriage\Nthus no Nobita born
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.09,0:37:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That can go\Nthink of something, Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.60,0:37:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.53,0:37:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Human simulates Robot
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.13,0:38:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this carefully, Robot
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.14,0:38:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it turns\Nto be the same as that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.67,0:38:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the same like daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.38,0:38:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Tamako...in fact you are here
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.31,0:38:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Never talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.21,0:38:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be angry, please marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.22,0:38:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I will kill myself right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.49,0:38:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi, please don't be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.72,0:38:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you now, stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.39,0:38:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi, in fact you have really\Ngood feeling. I am so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.00,0:38:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I wait for you over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.90,0:38:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then this woman\Nwent to daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.35,0:38:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.21,0:38:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Tamako, what's the matter?\NYou even did that kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.45,0:38:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr. Nobi, I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.52,0:38:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.19,0:38:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well...really, Ms. Tamako{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.76,0:39:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Tamako...\Nwait for me a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.43,0:39:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, well done,\Nthis makes us not concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.44,0:39:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.44,0:39:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Tamako...\NLet's build up a happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.17,0:39:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we work hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.07,0:39:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, very successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.41,0:39:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But, whether they argued we don't know\NBecome peaceful again? Very concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.53,0:39:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Both daddy and mom are not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.86,0:39:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.84,0:39:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it'?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.51,0:39:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.64,0:39:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe divorced\Nboth gone from home away
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.74,0:39:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good, they can't do so...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.11,0:39:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not important\Nat all who proposed first.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.12,0:40:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we are the happiest\NIs that not enough'?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.16,0:40:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Why become angry\Nfor such tinny matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.29,0:40:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Really sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.23,0:40:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.19,0:40:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,These two are really good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.46,0:40:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.31,0:40:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Asia_cartoons@sinarnan.cor-n
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.41,0:40:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Machine arranging things before
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.99,0:40:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that this movie\Nis very interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.59,0:40:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ask daddy bring me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.50,0:40:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, a movie is currently in\Ncinemas. Bring me to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.00,0:40:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Its' called star war.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.87,0:40:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a quite sensational movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.37,0:40:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All tickets are sold out 1 month before\NMany just buy standing tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.61,0:40:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinemas are fully crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.45,0:41:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,See it half a year later what
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.58,0:41:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Dorayaki\NThis must be Doraemon's
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.32,0:41:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, eat it away
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.50,0:41:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Very strange, why can eat anything?\NWhat's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.77,0:41:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.87,0:41:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.24,0:41:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, is this Doraemon's?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.71,0:41:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Really nothing careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.68,0:41:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.31,0:41:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I wrote reservation card.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.12,0:41:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody except me can eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.32,0:41:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Reservation card...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.95,0:41:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This means this\NOnly Doraemon can eat Dorayaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.93,0:41:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want or do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.06,0:41:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just write it on reservation card\Nput it into reservation machine
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.93,0:41:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else can take\Nwhat I have reserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.47,0:41:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.34,0:42:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, can I reserve that one'?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.11,0:42:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Start war
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.11,0:42:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can see\Nthat movie any time
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.18,0:42:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful that's great...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.48,0:42:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then write it onto this card and\Nput it into the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.05,0:42:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Star war, three o'clock this\Nafternoon two good seats...Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.03,0:42:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.26,0:42:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem at all
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.83,0:42:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What nonsense are you talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.66,0:42:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, already reserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.80,0:42:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you reserve it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.50,0:42:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I bet with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.87,0:42:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If not reserved, I will do everyday\Nwhatever daddy tells me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.11,0:42:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll learn hard everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.81,0:42:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...okay
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.48,0:42:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So he promised me to bring me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.05,0:42:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.05,0:42:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am concerned again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.72,0:42:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing reserved well\NI have to learn hard everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.89,0:42:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.43,0:42:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Really no problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.49,0:42:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it if still in doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.16,0:42:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, is Nobita in?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.90,0:43:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.23,0:43:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I bring you the book you want to borrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.64,0:43:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, lam coming, wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.44,0:43:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you,\NI have been expecting this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.68,0:43:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful, I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.35,0:43:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.55,0:43:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.25,0:43:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.05,0:43:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that it's very interesting.\NLend me for a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.02,0:43:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When can I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.82,0:43:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,After they two finish
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.59,0:43:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.76,0:43:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Really angry, Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.03,0:43:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave these matters to machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.04,0:43:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I want to be\Nthe first one reading that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.54,0:43:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, start reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.72,0:43:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, why can't it be opened?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.58,0:44:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Really strange, why do I not want to see\Nit before Nobita sees it'?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.86,0:44:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see it first?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.66,0:44:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, see it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.23,0:44:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.87,0:44:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought it for me to see first.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.80,0:44:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.50,0:44:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you use past things?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.57,0:44:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The stamp last time can not be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.44,0:44:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can also use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.28,0:44:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.01,0:44:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I go and buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.61,0:44:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.59,0:44:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought it... I bought it...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.39,0:44:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Really great, really bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.46,0:44:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who\Nhave not bought can not accept it
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.03,0:44:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them what you bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.29,0:44:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do so, boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.03,0:44:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, Gian, Haruo\Nwait at home before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.20,0:44:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.80,0:44:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, get ready to start up\Nif you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.81,0:44:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I am coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.15,0:44:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time so many people on\Nbus. So I hate going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.78,0:45:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seats on bus are reserved\NThere must be seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.76,0:45:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.88,0:45:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So many people, you can see absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.01,0:45:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I say no problem.\NSo many people, you can see absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.02,0:45:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I say no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.42,0:45:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Nobita, I want two seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.52,0:45:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nobi's seat is\Nready. Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.49,0:45:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You see... Daddy, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.06,0:45:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.53,0:45:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really different with good seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.63,0:45:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice view, daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.64,0:45:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But, it's really a strange day
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.17,0:45:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.08,0:45:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Nobita\NWhat's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.28,0:46:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The phone is ringing\Nall the time since evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.48,0:46:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Phone...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.72,0:46:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you asked those three people\Nwaiting for you at home absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.32,0:46:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So they call you angrily\Nsince evening all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.02,0:46:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You never come however we wait for you\Nmaking me not going out at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.19,0:46:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I had appointment before...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.67,0:46:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, you pick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.27,0:46:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.84,0:46:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hi...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.11,0:46:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You guy, I will invite you\Nif you come to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.61,0:46:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go there\NI don't dare going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.75,0:46:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, just go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.65,0:46:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even think of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.49,0:46:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But you enjoyed a lot yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.02,0:46:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact you were bloody...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.69,0:46:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Call a doctor waiting for\Nyou at home. No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.43,0:46:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,asia_cartoon@hotmail.com
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.20,0:46:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanuki machine changing the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.97,0:47:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen to me\Nlam quite good at sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.58,0:47:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Only at sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.08,0:47:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, at others...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.98,0:47:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Really Gian?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.15,0:47:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Very hot... hot... hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.83,0:47:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Really too extreme
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.59,0:47:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That means
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.83,0:47:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, long time ago I thought\NNobita's face looked like...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.11,0:47:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.17,0:47:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I finally know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.25,0:47:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tanuki
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.12,0:47:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.32,0:47:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.82,0:47:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You are also laughing, right'?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.83,0:48:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned, this guy Suneo...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.87,0:48:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much extreme
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.64,0:48:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.67,0:48:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You even say Nobita looks like Tanuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.48,0:48:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.99,0:48:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.09,0:48:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.76,0:48:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Please
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.66,0:48:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita is abused\Nmeaning I am abused.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.50,0:48:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.34,0:48:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanuki machine changing body.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.37,0:48:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this eyeglass or tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.01,0:48:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.21,0:48:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to my explanation
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.82,0:48:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There used to be Tanuki playing\Nhumans. Do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.69,0:48:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the mountains, although\Nday time, it turns to be night.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.66,0:49:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Make people lose their way change the\Nfigures to monster, shit to food
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Really change your body if put this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.97,0:49:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, glass frame is antenna\Nsending your brain waves to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.98,0:49:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Making others fantasies about you
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.02,0:49:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi...don't make me an experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.89,0:49:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's night with moon shine\Nlam Tanuki,pong...pong...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.83,0:49:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend, it's pong... pong...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.17,0:49:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How great. I borrow this one, Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.38,0:49:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, wait Suneo
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.26,0:50:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, turn from here. It's\Nthe store stree,how come...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.61,0:50:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How come this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.44,0:50:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Set up by Tanuki'?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.48,0:50:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In this scientific time...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.88,0:50:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, go home
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.99,0:50:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, original road disappears
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.39,0:50:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No more kidding, even no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.76,0:50:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even lost your way in such big mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.60,0:50:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Go over there and see
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.70,0:50:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,it's soon sun set
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.17,0:50:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Very bad
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.01,0:50:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way would be better?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.45,0:51:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anybody for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.85,0:51:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wolf, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.02,0:51:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there is a hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.26,0:51:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful we can spend a night here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.90,0:51:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.53,0:51:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow beautiful woman
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.67,0:51:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't; you fell\Nlonely living here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.14,0:51:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Suneo?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.14,0:51:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Over slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.05,0:51:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it seems very tasteful food.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.18,0:51:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very hungry when lost my way in the\Nmountain. Can I get some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.82,0:51:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to start
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.16,0:51:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It does not work.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.27,0:51:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems even more stranger\Nyou must be fox or Tanuki
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.91,0:52:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me pull out your tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,'WHY\NDon't"fl:'
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.45,0:52:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your real face.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.75,0:52:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo is crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.85,0:52:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.89,0:52:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You dared to cheat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.46,0:52:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, wake up, Suneo
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.33,0:52:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mon... it's monkey
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.57,0:52:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.68,0:52:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fat Gian
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.11,0:52:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka, Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.31,0:52:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Suneo don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.55,0:52:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.68,0:52:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop there, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.12,0:52:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo has learnt a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.73,0:52:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Very happy, hahaha...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.76,0:53:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Suneo...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.46,0:53:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned guy
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.20,0:53:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? How come\NNobita gets a face of Tanuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.14,0:53:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even mom say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.50,0:53:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's face is round
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.14,0:53:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's face is long
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.85,0:53:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebodys face is square
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.75,0:53:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's face is triangle
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.62,0:54:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If cry, become angry\Nplay temper
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.33,0:54:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Crying one will become a devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.40,0:54:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But be happy and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.20,0:54:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's face is actually round.
